        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle Sequence Diagram Tong Hop - Quan ly Khach hang (9 Tinh huong)\n\nautonumber\nactor \&quot;Nhan vien ban hang\&quot; as Staff\nboundary \&quot;Giao dien Quan ly Khach hang\&quot; as UI\ncontrol \&quot;Khach hang Controller\&quot; as CustCtrl\nentity \&quot;Khach hang\&quot; as CustEntity\nentity \&quot;Lich su &amp; Hoa don\&quot; as OrderEntity\n\nactivate Staff\n\n&#39; 1. Cập nhật thông tin KH &amp; 2. Thêm mới KH &amp; 3. Chỉnh sửa KH &amp; 4. Xóa KH &amp; 5. Kiểm tra dữ liệu KH\ngroup 1. Quan ly, Them, Sua, Xoa va Kiem tra du lieu KH\n    Staff -&gt; UI: Chon chuc nang Quan ly / Them / Sua / Xoa KH\n    activate UI\n    \n    alt Them moi / Chinh sua KH\n        UI -&gt; CustCtrl: thucHienThemHoacSuaKH(thongTinKH)\n        activate CustCtrl\n        \n        &#39; Use-case Kiểm tra dữ liệu KH (Include)\n        CustCtrl -&gt; CustCtrl: validateFormatSDT_Email(sdt, email)\n        alt Sai dinh dạng / Trùng SĐT\n            CustCtrl --&gt; UI: Bieu dien loi nhap lieu\n        else Hop le\n            CustCtrl -&gt; CustEntity: saveOrUpdateKH(thongTinKH)\n            activate CustEntity\n            CustEntity --&gt; CustCtrl: Xac nhan luu thanh cong\n            deactivate CustEntity\n            CustCtrl --&gt; UI: Thong bao cap nhat KH thanh cong\n        end\n        deactivate CustCtrl\n        \n    else Xoa KH\n        UI -&gt; CustCtrl: xoaKH(maKH)\n        activate CustCtrl\n        CustCtrl -&gt; CustEntity: kiemTraGiaoDichChuaHoanTat(maKH)\n        activate CustEntity\n        alt KH con giao dich / cong no\n            CustEntity --&gt; CustCtrl: Con giao dich\n            CustCtrl --&gt; UI: Thong bao khong the xoa do con giao dich\n        else KH hop le de xoa\n            CustEntity --&gt; CustCtrl: Khong con giao dich\n            CustCtrl -&gt; CustEntity: deleteKH(maKH)\n            CustEntity --&gt; CustCtrl: Xac nhan xoa\n            CustCtrl --&gt; UI: Thong bao xoa KH thanh cong\n        end\n        deactivate CustEntity\n        deactivate CustCtrl\n    end\n    UI --&gt; Staff: Hoan tat thao tac cap nhat KH\n    deactivate UI\nend\n\n&#39; 6. Tra cứu thông tin KH &amp; 7. Xem chi tiết KH &amp; 8. Tra cứu lịch sử mua hàng &amp; 9. Đổi trả &amp; Chi tiêu\ngroup 2. Tra cuu, Xem chi tiet, Lich su mua hang, Doi tra &amp; Chi tieu KH\n    Staff -&gt; UI: Thuc hien Tra cuu, Xem chi tiet ho so, Lich su mua &amp; Thong ke\n    activate UI\n    \n    alt Tra cuu va Xem chi tiet KH\n        UI -&gt; CustCtrl: traCuuVaXemChiTietKH(tuKhoa, maKH)\n        activate CustCtrl\n        CustCtrl -&gt; CustEntity: searchAndGetProfileKH(tuKhoa, maKH)\n        activate CustEntity\n        CustEntity --&gt; CustCtrl: Tra ve danh sach KH &amp; ho so chi tiet (hang the, diem)\n        deactivate CustEntity\n        CustCtrl --&gt; UI: Hien thi thong tin chi tiet ho so KH\n        deactivate CustCtrl\n        \n    else Tra cuu lich su mua hang, Xem doi tra &amp; Chi tieu\n        UI -&gt; CustCtrl: layLichSuVaThongKeKH(maKH)\n        activate CustCtrl\n        \n        CustCtrl -&gt; OrderEntity: getListHoaDonByKH(maKH)\n        activate OrderEntity\n        OrderEntity --&gt; CustCtrl: Tra ve danh sach hoa don cu\n        deactivate OrderEntity\n        \n        CustCtrl -&gt; OrderEntity: getListPhieuDoiTra(maKH)\n        activate OrderEntity\n        OrderEntity --&gt; CustCtrl: Tra ve danh sach doi tra\n        deactivate OrderEntity\n        \n        CustCtrl -&gt; CustCtrl: tinhTongChiTieuVaTanSuat()\n        \n        CustCtrl --&gt; UI: Hien thi lich su mua, phieu doi tra va chi so chi tieu/tan suat\n        deactivate CustCtrl\n    end\n    \n    UI --&gt; Staff: Hien thi day du thong tin phuc vu ban hang\n    deactivate UI\nend\n\ndeactivate Staff\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="de9cDZjoiY5hCQSktZtn-1">
